Association StudentSpecialEducationProgramEligibilityIDEAEventAssociation
    documentation "This association connects a series of IDEA events with a StudentSpecialEducationProgramEligibility record."
    domain entity IDEAEvent
        documentation "A reference to one or more related student IDEA events."
        is required
    association EdFi.StudentSpecialEducationProgramEligibilityAssociation
        documentation "A reference to the related student special education eligibility record."
        is required